=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Balasiel}, who will give you the {k:Book of Tasks} containing hints on how to proceed.
* Speak to {n:Cahaurme} (J-9) from (L-8) (In the "Tower" above the East Gate) to recieve {k:Book of the East}.
* Speak to {n:Baunise} (H-9) from (F-8) (In the "Tower" above the West Gate) to receive {k:Book of the West}.
* Go to the dead-end on the map at (E-10) in {z:Davoi} and examine the **Disused Well** to receive {@k} {k:Knight's soul}.

