:* Be mindful of {m:Orcish Farkillers|Orcish Farkiller} on the top of the ledge that can aggro even at level 99.

::* Pugils in the river will aggro to sound for characters near level 30, so take proper precautions depending on your level.

* Return to Balasiel to complete the quest.

